{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02609","headline":"古意六首 三 · 王绩","name":"古意六首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝龟尺二寸，由来宅深水。\n浮游五湖内，宛转三江里。\n何不深复深，轻然至溱洧。\n溱洧源流狭，春秋不濡轨。\n渔人递往还，网罟相萦藟。\n一朝失运会，刳肠血流死。\n丰骨输庙堂，鲜腴籍笾簋。\n弃置谁怨尤，自我招此否。\n余灵寄明卜，复来钦所履。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}